<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Status Change Notification</title>
</head>
<body>
    <p>Hello,</p>

    <p>The status of your Event ticket <strong><%= ticketId %></strong> has been changed.</p>

    <p><strong>Old Status:</strong> <%= oldStatus %></p>
    <p><strong>New Status:</strong> <%= newStatus %></p>

    <p>If you have any questions, please feel free to reach out to us.</p>

    <p>Best regards,</p>
    <p>Your Team</p>
</body>
</html>
